   "sourceHash": "9eadc93d42484ffcdc12f0a755f7519f6d0f5e571ee47131d8417d0cf4047a2d",
   "text": "在做出任何改变或出行之前，请先与您的肿瘤治疗团队讨论任何拟议的辅助治疗。请向双方团队咨询，在您当前的治疗阶段是否适合入住。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b7da947aa9f5fe037eba",
   "sourceHash": "b7da947aa9f5fe037eba45593c9383b38a7cd64b2dd2816596eb048ba91ab6fb",
   "text": "Kairali 理疗师在 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）药油淋注疗法中照护一位斜躺、敷着眼部敷垫的患者",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned word 'guest' rendered as '患者' (patient)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f283acfaf1fa03103077",
   "sourceHash": "f283acfaf1fa03103077d0b0eb0e4cb23cab33a0cf9100d428b2d8ce1ce02459",
   "text": "Kairali 入口处的象神（Ganesha）雕像，四周环绕着药用植物",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
